  "body": "**What.** #68's circles at M 64 (no cut, and kf 13) at D 30, on the fitted layout. Copy `I141-mac/states/modecount_state_D30.0688_M64.npz` into the data folder, or let setup rebuild it (821 s). Recommended in #141's summary (its task 2).\n\n**Why.** M 64 now converges (|F| 2.5e-26), and its det M passes the \u03bb_phys sign check.\n\n**Acceptance (can fail).** Setup's gates pass, and the windings are reported with their controls.\n\n**Depends on.** #141.",
