   "body": "**Started** (macm3, 05:41 UTC), no cut and then kf 13, 1 thread, nice 10, `caffeinate -is`, venv-macm3-314 (Python 3.14.3, python-flint 0.9.0, FLINT 3.6.0), worktree `../choptuik-large-d-i271` at 408b4d6. No D 30 M 64 state is in its `hp/data`, so each setup fits and converges its own, and both caches start empty. Raw folder `I251-macm3/`. Six single-thread jobs on this Mac now: #251, #273, #285, #286, #290, #291.",
