   "body": "**Restarted from the main checkout** (macm3, 05:42 UTC). The first launch failed in 10 s at both cuts with `module 'modecount_cx' has no attribute 'CSolver'`: the worktree has no `hp/modecount_cx/build`, which is an ignored build product of the main checkout. No determinant was evaluated. The same script now runs from `~/Source/choptuik-large-d` at bfe5fd54, whose `modecount_circle.py`, `modecount_common.py` and `hp/modecount_cx` are identical to 408b4d6's by `git diff`. The failed logs are kept as `*_attempt1.log`.",
