   "body": "**Progress** (macm3, 06:17 UTC, 35 min in on the second attempt). The no-cut setup passed: nodes [0.15, 0.3, 0.4, 0.5, 0.6, 0.7] (the centre series at 0.3 had ratio 1.086, so the layout fitted a node at 0.15), `|F|` 1.7e-11 after Newton and 1.7e-26 after Levenberg-Marquardt, series 6.8e-62 (centre, ratio 0.730 at 0.15) and 4.9e-32 (horizon). Both gates pass. The circles are running (2 determinants so far). The kf 13 cut follows. Machine: load 27, six compute processes, the Mac back on AC at 06:04 UTC (battery 23%, charging) after about 4 h 25 min on battery, during which each job ran at about 20% of a core. Wall times from 01:40 to 06:04 UTC are therefore not compute times. Raw: local commit 86ab666, **not yet pushed** (SSH down).",
